# Page objects

- Class: `{Screen}Page` : `PageBaseClass`
- Ctor: `public FooPage(IWebDriver driver, TestContext ctx) : base(driver, ctx)`
- Locators: private strings in `#region ObjectIdentifierValues`
- Elements: properties returning `FindAppElement(By.*)` — prefer `By.Id`, `By.Name`, `By.CssSelector`; XPath only if needed
- **No** `new` driver; **no** `Thread.Sleep`
- New pages: **do not** follow `GoogleHome` / `LinkedIn` plain POM — use `PageBaseClass`
- Golden: `STAFTests/Pages/LoginPage.cs`
